@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### List pets (union in the response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets

### One pet
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/2

### Add a dog (the "breed" property selects Dog)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Karabas", "breed": "Kangal" }

### Add a cat (the "lives" property selects Cat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Tekir", "lives": 9 }

### Ambiguous body: matches no case -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nemo" }

### Pattern matching on a union
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/3/sound

### Payment succeeded -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "4111111111111111", "amount": 150 }

### Payment declined -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "4111111111110000", "amount": 150 }

### Payment failed -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "4111111111111111", "amount": -5 }

### Readings: int or string in the same field
GET {{baseUrl}}/readings

### OpenAPI document (unions appear as anyOf)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
